    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναποδ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>going back,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς μονάδα,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προποδισμὸς ἀπὸ μονάδος,</span> Moderat. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Coroll.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; of the <i>retrograde</i> motion of planets, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				226.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>; in pl., opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προποδισμοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				440.7
			</span></i>; generally, <i>reversal</i> of planet's motion, Theo
				Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.148H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>calling back, recall,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>.</div>
